<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Hi {{lead.First Name:default=Friend}},</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Join us for our quarterly <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/q2-product-insights-open-forum?x-craft-preview=3e403c980dea6bf221003d3d86d806bbc5a8ea72966063f22b67e3eb26fa5712smppsntwdq&amp;token=KfCD-LCXIvIVZCQxraK7-cJqkHOQV4mg&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=" style="color: #147bd1;"><strong><u>Product Insights Open Forum</u></strong></a></span> taking place on <strong>Wednesday, July 16th at 2pm ET</strong>. This interactive webinar is designed to help ensure U.S. clients like you are able to get the best use out of their Flywire education solutions, while also having the opportunity to connect directly with our product team.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong>Here's what you can expect:</strong></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><strong>Exclusive product insights:</strong> Get updates on what’s new with our education solutions.</li> 
<li><strong>Explore what’s next:</strong> Review what’s new and get an update on future enhancements on the roadmap.</li> 
<li><strong>Live Q&amp;A session:</strong> Ask questions and engage directly with our product leads.</li> 
</ul> </td> 
